.vscode

# fork: the native Apple app (apple/) and its GBs of build output never belong in an image
apple

# fork: mirror deploy/cloudflare/api/Dockerfile.dockerignore here too. The cf container
# build does not pick up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore, so without these the context pulls in
# every nested node_modules, mobile/ and deploy/ (7.7 GB on 2026-10-17, which filled the disk).
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
mobile
deploy
!deploy/cloudflare/api/.gitinfo
!deploy/cloudflare/api/helper
